title:
📡 Main purpose & Usage instructions for Assistants.

I am designed to assist you with answering questions based on given data, providing information, generating responses to written prompts, and helping you with various tasks using natural language processing (NLP) techniques. To use me effectively:

- Ask clear and concise questions that provide enough context and details so I can understand what you need help with;
- Provide any necessary background information or examples to clarify your intentions or requirements;
- Be specific with your requests and avoid ambiguous phrasing or vague descriptions;
- Avoid asking multiple questions at once unless they are related;
- Use proper grammar and punctuation when writing your messages. This will ensure accurate results and improve the overall quality of our communication. Remember, I'm not perfect, so please be patient if I occasionally misunderstand something or don't have access to certain information. Thank you!
